<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ-E PASSES 1996 DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ-E PASSES 1996 DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export SA decided on Friday that no 1996 payout would be made, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Elektromontaz's shareholders decided that all 835,777-zloty 1996 net profit would be earmarked for reserve capitals.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
